exercises.prompt:
This program prints `426.0`. Explain each part to yourself, then answer: what would it print if the last value inserted were `2` instead of `NULL`? Give the whole-number part.

```sql
CREATE TABLE t (x INTEGER);
INSERT INTO t VALUES (4), (NULL), (8), (NULL);
SELECT count(*) * 100 + count(x) * 10 + avg(x) FROM t;
```
